  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify bounded effective-discrete-rate discounting and single-sign-change bracketed IRR with one compiled missing-API RED, 66 GREEN, 837 retained scientific tests, four Math regressions and six isolated SHA-identical local preview.13 NuGet clients. Preserve explicit caller-owned period/rate convention, no implicit day-count or market input, and typed nonpartial refusals. Close C04-T1 R/G/V and T1 only; keep C04-T2, C04, C05, M6-W02 and M6 unfinished.",
    "value": "Admit finite effective rates [-0.9,4], discount periods 0..32, bounded cashflows and a caller-supplied IRR bracket with exactly one nonzero cashflow sign transition. Distinguish invalid inputs, unbracketed roots and ambiguous sign patterns without claiming root uniqueness for arbitrary flows, numeric error certification or financial advice.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS101 success, prepare RS102 on M6-W02-C04-T2: explicit caller day-count/date conventions and nuanced multi-root/no-solution IRR boundary refusals with independent RED/GREEN and local NuGet integration. Retain C05, M6-W02 and M6 open.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Observe a genuinely compiled independent missing M6W02C04Contract public API RED before staging source; compiler failure is not RED evidence.",
      "Recover RED and pass 66 independent tests for effective-period discount amounts/rates/periods and bracketed single-sign-change IRR.",
      "Check 100 discounted at 10% for one period = 1000/11 and IRR([-100,110]) = 10% inside [0,0.5] as independent numeric oracles.",
      "Reject null/nonfinite/out-of-budget inputs and invalid finite rate/period/bracket boundaries with typed outcomes containing no partial numeric value.",
      "Admit only cashflows with exactly one nonzero sign transition and a caller-supplied sign-bracketed IRR; defer broader multiple-root classification to C04-T2.",
      "Preserve all 837 retained scientific tests from C01/C02/C03, the full scientific suite, four Math regression projects and transfer architecture validation.",
      "Pack and inspect a real BCL-only local scientific preview.13 NuGet archive with net10 assembly, exact nuspec version/dependencies, length and SHA-256.",
      "Requalify six independently restored source-free eight-probe clients with only a cleared local package feed, exact preview.13 pins and matching SHA.",
      "No market prices, investment advice, automatic calendar/day-count, nominal/continuous conversion or certified binary64 error theorem is implied.",
      "Close precisely C04-T1 R/G/V and T1; leave parent C04, its T2, C05, work package M6-W02 and milestone M6 unfinished."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C04-T1-R",
        "achievement": "Observe one independently compiled missing-public effective-discrete-rate discount and bracketed IRR API RED before source staging."
